From 18e4c783753e2aa761c86f6c61026fca389a51be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 01:27:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 074/183] net: omci: add in-kernel baseline agent and MIB

Move normal OMCI request handling into the kernel transport core. Add a
baseline message parser, automatic responses, duplicate suppression, an
xarray-backed operational MIB, initial ONU-created managed entities,
identity configuration, and Generic Netlink administration for agent
state, configuration, MIB inspection and local updates.

Keep raw PDU observation and transmission available for diagnostics, but
remove userspace from the normal OLT response path. Extended OMCI remains
transport-only for now.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
